        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ABOUT THIS GAME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It started with an email.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inside the attachment waits an innocent little spot-the-difference game. Nothing special - just one of thousands of strange files that used to drift around the old internet. Except once you run it, something stays with you longer than it should.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creepy Tales: Smile Dog</strong> is a desktop psychological horror inspired by the classic 2008 creepypasta. It’s a short, intense trip back to the age of old desktops, cluttered inboxes, and an internet that felt both naive and dangerous. And this time, there are <strong>five endings</strong> to uncover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Receive emails</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Check your messages, open attachments, and follow instructions that grow stranger with every step.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895360/extras/b30f5cd2ca83b9c2aff153c9d230ae6c.poster.avif?t=1782133216\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895360/extras/b30f5cd2ca83b9c2aff153c9d230ae6c.webm?t=1782133216\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895360/extras/b30f5cd2ca83b9c2aff153c9d230ae6c.mp4?t=1782133216\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the differences</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compare images, watch for unsettling changes, and mark details that absolutely should not be there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895360/extras/f78cd5fb0ed4a6759a1d63dbabd609d1.poster.avif?t=1782133216\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895360/extras/f78cd5fb0ed4a6759a1d63dbabd609d1.webm?t=1782133216\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895360/extras/f78cd5fb0ed4a6759a1d63dbabd609d1.mp4?t=1782133216\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Return to the era of the old internet</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a system inspired by the Windows XP days: play Minesweeper, browse folders full of photos, read BBS boards, and search for hidden traces buried in digital clutter from years ago.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895360/extras/e6fe8160f84469027f9783412e4eea91.poster.avif?t=1782133216\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895360/extras/e6fe8160f84469027f9783412e4eea91.webm?t=1782133216\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895360/extras/e6fe8160f84469027f9783412e4eea91.mp4?t=1782133216\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover 5 endings</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smile Dog returns in a new form. We keep the spirit of the original creepypasta alive, while adding new layers of story, secrets, and unease - all waiting to be uncovered in five different ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The desktop is alive</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Windows, files, errors, and system messages begin to behave as if your computer itself has become part of the horror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>⚠️ CONTENT WARNING ⚠️</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game contains:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Disturbing images and sounds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Themes of psychological horror</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Content that may cause anxiety or discomfort</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not recommended for sensitive players or children. <strong>Smile.jpg isn’t kidding.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895360/extras/8df663054341fd54671ade3fd88fe584.avif?t=1782133216\" width=1062 height=226 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
