ystem messages begin to behave as if your computer itself has become part of the horror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>⚠️ CONTENT WARNING ⚠️</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game contains:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Disturbing images and sounds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Themes of psychological horror</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Content that may cause anxiety or discomfort</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not recommended for sensitive players or children. <strong>Smile.jpg isn’t kidding.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895360/extras/8df663054341fd54671ade3fd88fe584.avif?t=1782133216\" width=1062 height=226 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
